  "level": 3,
  "title": "Parliamentary Counsel’s Office (PCO) drafts all Government Bills and all amendments to Bills required by Ministers during passage through Parliament. PCO also drafts — • regulations, rules, by-laws and other instruments of a legislative nature; and • various Executive Council minutes, proclamations, orders, commissions, warrants and other instruments."
 },
